BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Jane Austen Wrecked My Life
DTSTART:20250618T231500Z
DTEND:20250619T011000Z
DTSTAMP:20250618T231500Z
UID:xGbWThPrHV
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 94 mins (1h34m)\n\nAgathe (Camille Rutherford) is a 
 hopelessly clumsy yet charming young woman who works in the legendary Shak
 espeare & Co. bookshop in Paris\, while she dreams of being a successful w
 riter\, and of experiencing love akin to a Jane Austen novel\, she finds h
 erself desperately single and plagued by writers block. When Agathe’s be
 st friend (Pablo Pauly) gets her invited to the Jane Austen Writers' Resid
 ency in England\, she finally has her Jane Austen moment…and is caught i
 n a very unexpected romantic triangle. Agathe must let go of her insecurit
 ies to decide what she really wants for herself\, and to achieve her roman
 tic and professional dreams.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/ja
 ne-austen-wrecked-my-life
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Love
DTSTART:20250619T021500Z
DTEND:20250619T043500Z
DTSTAMP:20250619T021500Z
UID:Z0dE1MfUGV
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 119 mins (1h59m)\n\nIn defiance of societal norms\, 
 a pragmatic doctor and a compassionate nurse seek intimacy beyond the boun
 ds of conventional relationships. Part of director Dag Johan Haugerud's Se
 x-Love-Dreams trilogy.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/love
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
